Interview questions

    What evidence for Śambhunātha comes directly from Abhinavagupta?

    Was Jālandhara a place, lineage, pīṭha or all three?

    What did Abhinavagupta think Śambhunātha gave him that earlier teachers had not?

    How securely can the female dūtī be identified as Śambhunātha’s wife?

    Does Tantrāloka chapter 29 describe a regular communal rite, an exceptional initiation or a textual ideal?

    How much of Śambhunātha’s teaching can be reconstructed from Abhinavagupta’s work?

    Why did Śambhunātha’s independent lineage disappear from view?

    Does Jayaratha preserve information unavailable from Abhinavagupta?

    Are there manuscripts or commentarial traditions that name later disciples of Śambhunātha?

    How should filmmakers discuss Kaula ritual without either sanitizing or sensationalizing it?

