https://archive.org/details/Sat.Chakra.Nirupana
Arthur Avalon translated it in The Serpent Power

John Woodroffe, writing as Arthur Avalon, published the Sanskrit material with English translation and extensive commentary under the title The Serpent Power. Internet Archive preserves multiple editions and scans.

