    What is the earliest securely dated Kubjikā manuscript?

    Did the tradition originate in Kashmir, western India or another Kaula region?

    What does “Western Transmission” mean geographically?

    Why is the goddess crooked?

    Is Kubjikā equivalent to Kuṇḍalinī?

